== Effects ==
* Upon use, converts [[pickup]]s within the current room to [[Blue Fly|Blue Flies]] or [[Blue Spider]]s.
* Doubles Isaac's current amount of Blue Flies and Spiders.
** If Isaac has no Blue Flies or Spiders, spawns one Blue Fly or Spider.

== Notes ==
* {{dlc|r}} The item will cost 10 cents if found in a {{r|Shop}}
* Does not work on {{E|Troll Bomb}}s or {{E|Mega Troll Bomb}}s.
* One character using it does not seem to double the spiders/flies for other characters. It only seems to double the ones following the character using the item.
* {{dlc|r}} [[Locust]]s will not be doubled by Compost. 

== Synergies ==
* {{Book of Virtues synergy|description=Spawns a wisp in the middle ring if Compost destroys at least one pickup, and the wisp's health will be equal to the number of pickups converted to [[Blue Fly|Blue Flies]]/[[Blue Spider|Spiders]]. If Isaac hits the blue fly cap of 64 as a result of using Compost, all but one of Isaac's wisps will despawn.}}
* {{I|Car Battery}}: Spawns 2 Blue Flies or Blue Spiders for each pickup removed, quadruples the current amount and spawns two if there is none.
* {{T|Fish Tail}}: Isaac will gain twice as many flies per use, meaning each fly will be tripled.

